---

<Layout
  title="Digital Services | Phuc Loc Nguyen"
  description="Scale conversions, build community trust, and deploy lightning-fast headless websites. Explore my modern digital marketing and engineering services."
>
  <main class="gear-page">
    <div class="gear-container">
      
      <!-- HERO -->
